OL,3,GNEWSADuck attackers expose their
OL,4,Abottoms to volunteer
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree people seen attacking ducks in
OL,7,FDorset exposed their bottoms to a duck
OL,8,Fpatrol volunteer after they were
OL,9,Fconfronted, the BBC has been told.
OL,11,FThe woman said she heard a duck in
OL,12,Fdistress near the River Frome in
OL,13,FDorchester at 15:25 on Sunday and found
OL,14,Fthe men throwing objects at the birds.
OL,16,FWhen she shouted at the group to stop,
OL,17,Fthey turned towards her and exposed
OL,18,Ftheir bottoms before running away.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
